```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI as Streamlit UI
    participant Agent as Loan Manager
    participant Tools as Tools/Services

    User->>UI: Submit Application
    UI->>Agent: Process Loan(Application)
    activate Agent
    
    Agent->>Tools: Register Application
    Tools-->>Agent: Application ID
    
    par Investigation
        Agent->>Tools: Check Credit
        Agent->>Tools: Verify Employment
        Agent->>Tools: Check Fraud
    end
    
    Tools-->>Agent: Credit Report
    Tools-->>Agent: Employment Status
    Tools-->>Agent: Fraud Risk Score
    
    Agent->>Tools: Analyze Risk (DTI, etc.)
    Tools-->>Agent: Risk Assessment
    
    alt Needs Policy Check
        Agent->>Tools: Consult Policy (RAG)
        Tools-->>Agent: Policy Guidelines
    end
    
    alt Auto-Approve
        Agent->>UI: Approved
    else Needs Review
        Agent->>UI: Escalated to Human
    else Denied
        Agent->>UI: Denied
    end
    
    deactivate Agent
```